    "title": "DuPage County officials accuse clerk of financial mismanagement in censure - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alex Ortiz ,\n11 hours ago WHEATON, Ill. - The DuPage County Board voted to censure the County Clerk Jean Kaczmarek, accusing her of financial mismanagement of her department which has resulted in a lawsuit that’s cost taxpayers nearly $200,000 in legal fees. What we know:. The board voted overwhelmingly, 15-1, to approve the censure... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 7",
